flowchart TD
  Input{Source} -->|Small local file or recording| Bytes[Multipart bytes]
  Input -->|Large local file and Blob enabled| Upload[Direct public Blob upload]
  Input -->|Direct media URL| Download[Server bounded download]
  Upload --> URL[Validated staged URL]
  Bytes --> Plan[Build configured engine plan]
  URL --> Plan
  Download --> Plan
  Plan --> Try[Run adapter]
  Try --> Check{Outcome}
  Check -->|Text| Normalize[Normalize result and attempts]
  Check -->|Retryable and next available| Try
  Check -->|Nonretryable or exhausted| Fail[Structured error]
  Normalize --> Cleanup[Best-effort staged release]
  Fail --> Cleanup
  Cleanup --> Return[Return response]
  Upload -.-> Abandon[Abandoned and early-return cleanup gap]
